2026-07-27T10:48:59.8519785Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:48:59.8520311Z i /tmp/RtmpOUAnLX/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:48:59.8520652Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:48:59.8521076Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:48:59.8521442Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:48:59.8521990Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:48:59.8522810Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:48:59.8523756Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T10:48:59.8809076Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T10:48:59.8924696Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T10:48:59.9410080Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T10:48:59.9593713Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
